@startuml
' Context-level DFD for the Redis-like server

title Level 0 DFD - Redis-like Server

actor "Client" as Client
actor "Operator" as Operator

rectangle "0 Redis-like Server" as Server

database "Snapshot file\n(dump.snap)" as Snapshot
database "Append-only file\n(appendonlydir/)" as Aof
database "Log file\n(redis_server.log)" as Log

Client --> Server : RESP or inline commands
Server --> Client : RESP replies

Operator --> Server : options (CLI, config file,\nenvironment), SIGINT / SIGTERM
Server --> Log : log lines, watchdog warnings,\ncrash reports
Log --> Operator : reads

Server --> Snapshot : SAVE, BGSAVE, shutdown save
Snapshot --> Server : load at startup
Server --> Aof : every write command, rewrites
Aof --> Server : replay at startup\n(instead of the snapshot)

@enduml
